1
00:00:00,987 --> 00:00:03,687
Oh! Five more minutes.

2
00:00:04,624 --> 00:00:06,384
(Leonard:)That's what you said five minutes ago.

3
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,690
(Leonard:)Amy and Penny are already in the car,
move it.

4
00:00:08,862 --> 00:00:12,022
(Sheldon:)How come I never get to do
anything I wanna do?

5
00:00:12,299 --> 00:00:15,359
(Howard:)If he really wants to stay and finish,
I can give him a ride home.

6
00:00:15,535 --> 00:00:18,475
(Sheldon:)Please, Leonard. He said it's okay.

7
00:00:19,472 --> 00:00:22,502
(Leonard:)Sheldon, it's...
Wait, I can go home without you? Bye.

8
00:00:24,044 --> 00:00:26,534
(Sheldon:)Howard, I have a few questions.

9
00:00:26,713 --> 00:00:29,343
(Sheldon:)I found three bowling pins.

10
00:00:29,516 --> 00:00:33,716
(Sheldon:)Now, do you juggle these
or are you missing seven?

11
00:00:34,654 --> 00:00:36,884
(Sheldon:)- Juggle.
- You health nuts kill me.

12
00:00:41,161 --> 00:00:44,031
Oh, my God, it's beautiful!

13
00:00:44,197 --> 00:00:46,897
And look,
you found the juggling pins I hid.

14
00:00:47,334 --> 00:00:48,994
Now, a couple more items.

15
00:00:49,169 --> 00:00:52,159
(Sheldon:)Howard, I found this letter
from your dad in a box.

16
00:00:52,339 --> 00:00:56,209
- Based on content, it could either be filed...
- Wait, you opened this?

17
00:00:56,376 --> 00:00:59,366
I had to find out if it's
personal correspondence or memorabilia.

